---
import SubPageLayout from "../../../layouts/SubPageLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<SubPageLayout
  title="Agentic AI | Karsten Uhlig"
  description="A market thesis on the implementation wave and hands-on work with agentic systems for search marketing and decision support."
  language="en"
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Area"
    headline="Agentic AI"
    intro="A market thesis on the implementation wave and hands-on work with agentic systems for search marketing and decision support."
  />

  <section class="featured">
    <div class="featured-eyebrow">Featured</div>
    <a href="/en/agentic-ai/sem-agentic" class="featured-card">
      <div class="featured-title">sem-agentic</div>
      <div class="featured-desc">
        Working product map, patterns and engineering insights. An agentic AI pilot
        developed hands-on and documented openly.
      </div>
      <div class="featured-meta">View detail page →</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/agentic-ai/signal-steering" class="featured-card">
      <div class="featured-title">signal-steering</div>
      <div class="featured-desc">
        Three measurement methods, the same channel, three answers. A prototype with
        known ground truth that makes it possible to test which method captures the
        real value contribution and where the next budget should go.
      </div>
      <div class="featured-meta">View detail page →</div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="featured featured-secondary">
    <div class="featured-eyebrow">Behind the work</div>
    <a href="/en/agentic-ai/how-i-work-with-ai" class="featured-card featured-card-secondary">
      <div class="featured-title">How I work with AI</div>
      <div class="featured-desc">
        Not commercial proof, but the AI engineering practice behind it: Claude Chat
        and Claude Code as a pair, an honest maturity tracker and patterns from the
        Augur engineering work.
      </div>
      <div class="featured-meta">View detail page →</div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="featured featured-secondary">
    <div class="featured-eyebrow">Perspective</div>
    <a href="/en/agentic-ai/awareness-was-never-the-bottleneck" class="featured-card featured-card-secondary">
      <div class="featured-title">Awareness was never the bottleneck</div>
      <div class="featured-desc">
        The distance between a technology demo and measurable impact is where the actual work begins.
      </div>
      <div class="featured-meta">Read perspective →</div>
    </a>
  </section>
</SubPageLayout>

<style>
  .featured {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .featured-secondary {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .featured-card-secondary {
    padding: 1.35rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
  }
  .featured-card-secondary .featured-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .featured-card-secondary .featured-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .featured-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .featured-card {
    display: block;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-soft);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      background 0.2s ease,
      transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .featured-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.45);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .featured-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .featured-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .featured-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-amber);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
